{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01VG9mbCfN1bEbUq2ZkPdoWJ","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-GvqiYm/translated_rust/CONFIGS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a5a5c366-7b13-48c9-a820-e7aa27b1e5c6","uuid":"c5feaede-7f47-4af2-a5f7-65062a7a3b77","timestamp":"2026-08-19T23:57:25.345Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-GvqiYm/translated_rust/CONFIGS.md","oldString":"| C12 | `tokenizer_load_text` + `next_token` loop | buffer-length boundaries: 1, 8190, 8191 bytes of text | [x] |","newString":"| C11b | `tokenizer_load_text` + `next_token` loop | multi-line `/* */` comments that reset `current_column` in the middle of a token, so that `create_token`'s `current_column - token.length` goes **negative** (81 shapes × 3 newline placements) | [x] |\n| C12 | `tokenizer_load_text` + `next_token` loop | buffer-length boundaries: 1, 8190, 8191 bytes of text | [x] |","originalFile":"# CONFIGS.md — configuration surface table (Phase A + Phase B)\n\nAxes derived mechanically from the C source (not from docs):\n\n**Runtime options / modes the public API can set**\n\n| axis | states | where the C branches on it |\n|------|--------|-----------------------------|\n| loaded buffer | `tokenizer_load_text` sets `input_buffer`/`buffer_length` and resets position | `tokenizer.c:318-336` |\n| scan position | `current_position`, `current_line`, `current_column` | `peek_char`/`advance_char` |\n| lookahead slot | `lookahead_valid` 0/1 set by `tokenizer_peek_token` | `tokenizer.c:247-250, 302-308` |\n| cumulative stats | `total_{lines,tokens,chars}_processed`, **never** reset by `tokenizer_reset` | `tokenizer.c:310-316, 338-342` |\n| analyzer `initialized` | 0 before `analyzer_init`, 1 after | `analyzer.c:70, 196` |\n| analyzer `tokenizer_ops` | the 5